cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite as below."
type: software
title: "calion: District Heating Dispatch Optimization Framework"
abstract: >
  Code and data package for 'Topology Abstraction and Physics Fidelity Effects
  on Dispatch Optimization of Electrified District Heating Networks'.
  Five model levels (L1 copperplate to L3NL MIQCP) implemented in Pyomo/Gurobi,
  validated against industrial operational data.
  v1.1.0 (2026-07-28) is a corrected re-release: four model fixes (pump-power
  attribution, demand_fraction, fine-PWL pump friction, and a 0.6 bar transfer-station
  differential-pressure term), all runs re-solved from commit c19d690. See CHANGELOG.md.
